  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2017-04-17T21:54:38-04:00\" title=\"Monday, April 17, 2017, 9:54 pm\">April 17, 2017</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p><img class=\"size-medium wp-image-2326 aligncenter\" src=\"/media/archive/303f8efc59107fc252a337cb7564565509af18e8ffd8168535b853505dc692e0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"261\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>Guild of Harwich Artists President, <a href=\"/artists/doris-mee/\">Doris Mee</a>, won First Prize for her mixed media piece, “Sunset Over the Dune” in the Yarmouth Art Guild Spring Show at The Cultural Center of Cape Cod in South Yarmouth. The exhibit runs from April 12 through April 23, 2017.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>The Cultural Center of Cape Cod<br />\n307 Old Main Street<br />\nSouth Yarmouth, MA 02664<br />\nphone: (508) 394-7100</p>\n<p>HOURS<br />\nMonday through Friday: 9am-5pm<br />\nSaturday: 11am-5pm<br />\nSunday: noon-5pm<br />\nEvery evening, by chance.</p>\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-3b7a7197884c65093e45/\" rel=\"tag\">THE ART GALLERY</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-e23b79be08a822c7b682/\" rel=\"tag\">WHAT'S NEW</a></span>\t\t\t<br /><span class=\"entry-terms post_tag\">Tagged <a href=\"/archive/source-6cdd8ce6d1adae8ceb87/\" rel=\"tag\">Cape Cod Artist</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-ca2a1c0bde236338a43a/\" rel=\"tag\">Doris Mee</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-4eb958c8ea474845bb0f/\" rel=\"tag\">The Guild of Harwich Artists</a>, <a href=\"/archive/source-64e95fc634376c53b532/\" rel=\"tag\">Yarmouth Art Guild</a></span>\t\t</footer>\n\n\t\n",
